  "accepted_new_scoped_results": [
    "Finite-cutoff AU(da) Schur transfer on actual coprimeSF product support with true endpoints/finiteheight/Frobenius norm error and explicit fixed-complex-W Mellin seminorm; no entrywise AU factorization or shrinkage.",
