    "Equalnorm COPRIME off-diagonal columns are conjugate split-only rational-squarefree orientations. The full primal sector is elementary target-size and its exact Dirichlet-norm/orientation mean is retained.",
    "Pure literal primary-ray CRT/Poisson recombination gives an exact common-modulus band and a surviving S-local mean channel; automatic finite-ray cancellation attempt fails. It proves no band target bound."
  ],
  "actual_cubic_normalized_divisor_band_bound": "M(W)^2(DYA2)^epsilon A2 A1^(1-sigma)D^(2sigma-1)Y^(-sigma)min{Phi6(Y,D/E),(Y/E)Theta3(E,D/E)}; fixed0<sigma<1/2,1<=E<=D/2,U<=sqrtD, sameC/rho1, identity d-class ONLY",
