  "proved_equalnorm_sector": "|S_eq|<=O(B² Rw D^epsilon), Rw<=O(R)<=O(H). Fixed-W full h1 target iff corresponding unequalnorm target, up to this elementary sector.",
  "equalnorm_prefix_and_complement": "|P_eq(<=Y)|/D<=O(B² eps RY/D); signed complement<=O(B²[D^epsilon Rw+eps RY/D]) by exact whole-minus-prefix. PureY~D/mixedY~D^(7/6) target-size EQ only.",
